  "stem": "The mean of the 25 scores on a 50-point quiz was recorded as 18. Later, the teacher found that one score had been entered as 47 instead of the correct score, 22. What is the correct mean of the 25 scores?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "17"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Recorded total: \\(25 \\cdot 18 = 450\\).",
    "The correct total is \\(47 - 22 = 25\\) less: \\(450 - 25 = 425\\).",
    "Correct mean: \\(\\frac{425}{25} = 17\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "r = Rational(25 * 18 - 47 + 22, 25)\nassert r == 17\nassert Rational(spr_answers[0]) == r and len(spr_answers) == 1",
